From 815423be32e08ef895a8124e8d746cc52c3126e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Levine <blahm1d@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 22:19:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] Local Y-unit patches on birdybro 39c7aaf (P0001-P0003)

Accumulated local patches for the Smash T.V. / Y-unit integration, kept on
this branch so `main` stays pristine at birdybro's 39c7aaf for clean upstream
pulls. All documented in PATCHES.md.

- P0001: reset-vector read (CORE_RESET -> CORE_RESET_VEC reads mem[0xFFFFFFE0]
  32-bit -> PC). Required to boot a real game.
- P0002: hoist 33 forward-referenced decls for Questa FSE 25.1std
  declaration-before-use (behavior-neutral; tool in patches/).
- P0003: TMS34010 ANDI immediate is one's-complemented. Decoder used
  ALU_OP_AND (Rd & imm) but the TI assembler stores ~K (real ROM: "ANDI 1Fh"
  = 0xFFFFFFE0), so the op must be Rd & ~imm. Fix: ALU_OP_ANDN. Every ANDI was
  silently wrong (no illegal op, so it survived boot). Root-caused via the MAME
  debugger + unidasm against the Smash T.V. boot RAM-test field-size setup;
  verified FS1=16 (was 0/32), palette stride matches MAME, tb_immi_il PASS
  (its ANDI vector corrected to encode the complemented immediate),
  tb_yunit_boot PASS.

